%% User Registration Sequence
sequenceDiagram
    title User Registration - CharAI Backend

    actor Farmer
    participant Frontend
    participant "Backend API" as API
    participant "Auth Service" as Auth
    database Database

    note over Farmer,API: User creates an account
    Farmer->>Frontend: Enter registration info
    Frontend->>API: POST /register (user info)
    API->>Auth: Validate and create user
    Auth->>Database: Save user data
    Database-->>Auth: Success
    Auth-->>API: Return JWT token
    API-->>Frontend: Signup success
    Frontend-->>Farmer: User logged in